    {
      "id": "14649",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 I have had to update the user story for this component for tablet behaviour specifically. Added 1 ac:\n\\*\\*Tablet behaviour –\\*\\* `display=4`\nThe `size` prop should also account for tablet. When the team configures `display=4`, tablet will only render 3 product cards — the 4th is hidden. This prevents an orphaned card from sitting awkwardly on its own row, as tablet uses a 3-column grid system.\n----\nsee figma templates: [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann\\*Design\\*System\\*2026?node-id=40000257-6983](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann\\*Design\\*System\\*2026)\n![\"image-20260914-015517.png\"](image-20260914-015517.png)\nCC: User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510",
