  "description": "As a Developer,\n\nI want a reusable `editorial-card-group` React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec,\n\nso that it can render editorial content blocks across pages including PLP, Homepage, and any other pages requiring an editorial content zone.\n\n----\n\nThe component renders between one and four editorial card slots in a row. Each card displays a title above a full-bleed image/video, with caption text and a text CTA below. The component does not own its content — all text, image/video sources, and link destinations are passed as props. It renders with mock/hardcoded content at this stage; Contentful integration is covered separately.\n\n### Component props\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|qty|1, 2, 3, 4|Number of card slots|\n|layout|default, hero, short|Controls how the row sits within the page grid|\n|cards[]|array|Title, image/video, caption Heading, caption description, CTA|",
